        - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 14b1c5230b317074b8251810d5264494, type: 2}
          amount: 30
        equip: 1
    - rid: 287758218191176005
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 97e3d1a32d7e4518b91b0d5c5e47c7d2
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 287758218191176006
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7de89dfa0465455fa9a946afd60149cb
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
        line: A bow! Then there are two of us. It wants both hands, so your torch went into your pack. Press L to swap bow and torch whenever you need the light. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot.
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 287758218191176007
      type: {class: GiveItemsNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: eaf5291ff4964641a66fa469abc10cc8
        position: {x: 1240, y: 230}
        items:
        - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7e69e97c2a5edf149a174a57b97507dc, type: 2}
          amount: 1
        equip: 1
    - rid: 287758218191176008
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b6018d47fe6e4a8ca694bf9db8e219fc
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 287758218191176009
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6c61254c6ac1429e956b3343133a1f30
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
        line: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and you keep the torch in your other hand.
        afterFightPause: 1
