    - rid: 287758218191175977
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 32966d984aa043dda40cd20b0046d1e0
        position: {x: 940, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
        line: That is no thunder. An old one, a mountain troll, and it is walking towards our fire.
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 287758218191175978
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d846e196665147669e5fb0466ecd4dc2
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
        line: It hasn't seen us yet. It will smell the smoke soon enough.
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 287758218191175979
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5637c00fa3e64e4eb5619bd0817c537c
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
        line: Leave the fire! Follow the old road north, to the standing stones. Now!
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 287758218191175980
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
