--- !u!114 &983162864
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 983162858}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2bf080be06a0e604cb9cf97b1f099a15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestGiver
  quest: {fileID: 0}
  greeting: 
  waitingLines:
    lines: []
    order: 0
  turnInText: 
  afterLines:
    lines:
    - Hold together! Nobody gets left behind. We will find each other, whatever happens.
    order: 0
  showMarker: 1
  offers:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0279feb93b7c8b74e9fd8683d9d10fd3, type: 2}
    text: 'The villages sent us to investigate the rumours: trolls leaving their crags, witches walking the roads, even wolves attacking without warning. Something has bewitched these woods. We cannot find the cause in this storm. Keep your torch up and follow the old road. Find dry shelter; we will follow you.'
    acceptText: I will find us shelter.
    waitingText: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4f625534621489e4183de610d93d4f36, type: 2}
    text: Dry stone overhead. Good work. We need warmth before anyone can think clearly. Gather four Sticks and six Small Rocks nearby; there is loose fuel on the forest floor.
    acceptText: I will gather the supplies.
    waitingText: The villages sent us because livestock vanished and people saw witches on the road. Now trolls leave their hills, and even wolves attack without hunger. We find the cause, then we go home together.
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ba326763b19a9e46be36507850aed82, type: 2}
    text: That is enough. Let us put your building skills to use. Press G to open Build, choose Campfire and place it on open ground beside the shelter. The supplies you collected will pay for it.
    acceptText: I will build the campfire.
    waitingText: The villages sent us because livestock vanished and people saw witches on the road. Now trolls leave their hills, and even wolves attack without hunger. We find the cause, then we go home together.
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2306560eba5c594886d38a592bdb05d, type: 2}
    text: A fire at last. Stay close for a moment and catch your breath. Speak with the others; each of them has seen something different in these woods.
    acceptText: Let us catch our breath.
    waitingText: The villages sent us because livestock vanished and people saw witches on the road. Now trolls leave their hills, and even wolves attack without hunger. We find the cause, then we go home together.
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5699d07d5ceee6144855cc88c1a5f255, type: 2}
    text: These markings are older than the road. Sigrid says they may be a way out, and does not say how she knows. Touch the waystones and see if they still answer. We will hold the clearing.
    acceptText: I will try the waystones.
    waitingText: Hold together! Nobody gets left behind. We will find each other, whatever happens.
  speakerName: Sigrid
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueCameraDistance: 0.65
