  forestLine: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
  campLine: There are old paths here, older than the villages. My teacher said the waystones connected places of shelter. I thought that was only a story.
  portalLine: The stones are answering you. Stay close. I will try to keep the passage open.
