  forestLine: We came to learn why this forest has become bewitched. First, we need shelter. Follow the old road.
  campLine: This stone is dry enough. Give me sound timber and a little daylight, and I could make somewhere worth staying. For now, this fire will do.
  portalLine: Stay near the stones. We can still get out of this together.
  campTopics: []
  alchemist: 0
  supportInterval: 6
  supportAmount: 8
